{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Get precomputed 12-month Korean government and public-agency contract totals and recent awards for a KOSPI-listed company or other corporate supplier from the Public Procurement Service (KONEPS), cross-linked with DART corporate identifiers. Use this to evaluate a Korean company's public-sector delivery track record when you have an 8-digit DART corp_code, 6-digit KRX stock_code, or 10-digit business_registration_no (call kr_company_search first if you only have a name). Returns company identifiers (including business_registration_no), period (with basis: \"original_signed_date\"), 12-month contract_count, joint_contract_count, total_amount_krw, breakdowns by_category (goods, construction, services, foreign) and by_contract_type (lump_sum, unit_price, multi_year), top 5 government buyers, and up to 20 recent contracts with KONEPS detail URLs; if the company has no contracts in the window, returns found=true and has_procurement=false with a \"No procurement in last 12 months\" message. Pass business_registration_no to kr_business_status to verify live National Tax Service status, or corp_code to kr_company_profile for DART financials. Limitations: corporate entities only (sole proprietors are excluded). The 12-month window is by original contract signing date (period.basis = \"original_signed_date\"): it covers contracts first signed in the period, and excludes amendments registered in the period to contracts signed earlier. Amounts are in KRW from KONEPS; the 12-month total counts sole contracts in full and joint contracts by the supplier's share (joint contracts without a published share are counted but not summed), multi-year contracts count only the current-period amount, and unit-price (framework) contracts are reported separately because their values are ceilings, not spend. Read-only, keyless.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"any